    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78028" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-θραύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>break, smash</i>, of ships and pottery, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Dialex.</u>
				1
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>break off</i>, metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν εἰρήνην ψηφίσματι πολέμου π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demad.
					44
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλίγον τοῦ λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					4.623
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				9.931
			</span></i>; <i>infringe, violate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δίκαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					3.1
				</span></i>
			:—so in 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρατεθραυμένος</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αυσμένος</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				757e
			</span></i>.</div>
